  "post_content": "<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Merriweather Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 19px; margin: 0px 0px 1.8em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span lang=\"ca-ES\" style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Aquest divendres, 29 de setembre, s&#39;inicien a Ribesalbes les festes de la tardor, que s&#39;extendran fins diumenge 8 d&#39;octubre i que ja van tindre el seu pr&ograve;leg dissabte 23 amb la baixada del Crist des del calvari (40 fotos).</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/baixadacristribesalbes17/dsc_5743.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_5743\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/baixadacristribesalbes17/dsc_5747.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_5747\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/baixadacristribesalbes17/dsc_5750.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_5750\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/baixadacristribesalbes17/dsc_5751.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_5751\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/baixadacristribesalbes17/dsc_5753.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_5753\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/baixadacristribesalbes17/dsc_5754.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_5754\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/baixadacristribesalbes17/dsc_5756.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_5756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/baixadacristribesalbes17/dsc_5758.jp